          <li>Oracle, "The Set Interface," The Java Tutorials. <a href="https://docs.oracle.com/javase/tutorial/collections/interfaces/set.html">docs.oracle.com/javase/tutorial</a></li>
          <li>K. H. Rosen, <i>Discrete Mathematics and Its Applications</i>, 8th ed. McGraw-Hill, 2019, Section 2.2 (Set operations).</li>
